{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_07",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e9bfaec02b658c759d03ab89db0a1df887aeb75d9f1f01fc2a4ecce20fd01149",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d8ec8f2041182d2e99687966e020e406e1545363995c5453b128e7766498a0",
      "text": "惊叹吧，轰鸣吧，都筑圭！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d0a8babc509bcd8da1fd6f8d31ed0730f4b9ce66417cfe64a73614b4905f3d",
      "text": "Altessimo决定参加男极“现场表现力部门”。\n然而丽却瞒着圭，和想乐一起来到了杂货店。\n看着琳琅满目的商品，丽陷入了沉思。\n他来到这家店的理由究竟是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51d39c80da2f26abefd7427cb3be75f0a254e75e67fae69f1f2588cf2c58910a",
      "text": "第7话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d8ec8f2041182d2e99687966e020e406e1545363995c5453b128e7766498a0",
      "text": "惊叹吧，轰鸣吧，都筑圭！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b5a7b7aaaed110eb729b253f5100e448e0df1277b21095b9cda452ba830bfad",
      "text": "杂货店",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7105c3af297a1335fbe3cc0a93a90f3f4a39a7ea8045a163b32fbd61e73dc11",
      "text": "这是……？\n为什么这里会卖成捆的钞票呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b25abbb0ea6ba1b1bef63b86f946aaf797b760be7f1bf64afe442e00adc1c76",
      "text": "啊，那个不是钞票，背面其实是\n便签本哦～翻过来看看～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d82f514e9431809909dfe8a97ebe64989fe66a7e0b7d9922fddc9dfdbba0f6",
      "text": "……！原来如此。\n仔细看的话，正面也能看出是假的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab4612e016054409c4e7013444315f45b39c27a84ad74786e50d8fb7cf72bc2",
      "text": "这个是会喷水的打火机。\n这个呢，是坐上去会发出响声的垫子哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5295508f38305dabbd3b403ed3973fed956d6a6cef08b6c61bff69a140c00017",
      "text": "居然有各种各样的整蛊道具啊……！\n谢谢你，北村先生。受教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff79cf975e5273c59c904fd02411a020a76d81d45024beb14b706e72ee94ff29",
      "text": "嗯……到底哪样商品，\n才能让那位都筑先生也吓一跳呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b035760c698cd63a2949088efb6f55bd10a5221fe933da2f5e25edc6ce4dbc17",
      "text": "我说，丽君。Altessimo参加的，\n是男极“现场表现力部门”对吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b42846d8538f6cc0614554cba5dd3decd9fe7a8d601804cdd896d564c9b57766",
      "text": "比赛的内容应该是比谁能把现场观众\n的情绪调动得更高涨吧。我记得是这样的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d13de2634081e305f8cecab57030f3ef7d82b60077492f4423f62479f59e7d",
      "text": "为什么会需要这种东西呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9dc9bac9cb09b02027725b553d2d29990f934c2d1b364bd99a8576a13fc99eb",
      "text": "这、这是因为……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1a80ffcae25c879e85336922bac1d02a62cbefada6656128a8ed9ba5983ea6",
      "text": "碰头会中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a3e0fe4b941235eff49818d142b1be45e8d8a4014e664bb042f12fefcdbe73f",
      "text": "“在Altessimo的音乐中获得了勇气。\n今后也会继续为你们加油！”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:927b52583f3650cf8c6dff51bbdd78a316a2df48382ee0d37c83cf987176f532",
      "text": "粉丝信真让人感激。它让我们知道，\n我们的音乐切实地传达到了某人的心中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6b9d3e59b3787ff022408f66e70bc8354ea13211ac9d179a2bb127a1da245d2",
      "text": "你看起来很高兴呢，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92167b48392afd8a5bec8b019d2cdccb44af41f0e463f4577ce7574af877dc51",
      "text": "是、是的。这样可不行。\n差点忘记了原本的目的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8bb7a1f99e5c54947ad67693c23126d2b73babdbe6538048f93c31710c702dd",
      "text": "这次Altessimo要参加的，\n是男极“现场表现力部门”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c04d9d896737b9d9c003c871dcc5584c178a06088b305c7119d7c5b8136e9eb",
      "text": "为了了解观众所期望的舞台表现，\n我们才像这样开始读信的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86c07d3100c5b9c422bfd0f9261cbab88b972d608f615c870a998098c3efc4e",
      "text": "这封信里有写意见哦。\n“超超超级喜欢Altessimo的音乐！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fdd072c93944179d0a1195a4c896c5227644e2a9d8d89885130413ebbee5e2b",
      "text": "“如果愿望能实现的话，真想在耳边\n听听两个人的歌声！”上面这样写着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b208385d32c6b48d8a954bc4347b709bff384a854c4358c0d19ff9238273afcd",
      "text": "这样啊……但是，在演唱会中\n要在耳边唱歌是很难做到的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07415d9aafc6be738a725ce41940d2a471a6b389c9bfe39015dbb530834cbfba",
      "text": "那在副歌的部分，\n走到这个人的座位旁边唱给他听吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2301d56935378fa615af92f371f2b476359bb88904d6bdd2eb2a8acd99343e7",
      "text": "难得有机会，把麦克风交给他\n一起唱怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a99c59c07e08654e7b032d6f3b3def9161eb090f9fda28518254f743802a187",
      "text": "不，干脆，\n让他站在我们面前唱也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c792e3b75a8aecba75b6ea8915a4f743aa3ddee8fd605b70b2aa865c2aafa8",
      "text": "（被以前当过音乐家的两位这么对待，\n对方恐怕会更加紧张吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1d9564951a613165cf17ff6d6d007cc2af9b24a3ba88ad46ec071cccb75bec",
      "text": "嗯——……只要我们演奏出音乐，\n我觉得那样就足够了呀……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d613358793505f3c5f6681e34cbf05cf3fb7a65efeed98948fdedc5cff00639b",
      "text": "只要能和丽先生一起唱歌，我就很幸福了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c924ab7dfe5efe3de204e5d4a57cda6dcfef337f664fac84fb5c4590e7febac8",
      "text": "但是，丽先生好像不一样呢。\n就那么想拿下那个叫男极KING的称号吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ea4f8046d58f14e2014f56d1b76b4d4bde7cc6c7c11bfac1fff266100ef7a44",
      "text": "我想拿下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d99696b57713b48e468a854156ef08962b90a5aae19176796c15e096d61d38",
      "text": "……成为偶像之后，\n我从自己的音乐中感受到了“未知的可能性”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b517009f5d5c6ac80a495ba54405ae3e7b5c1dcdea990788455910a7c185ff3b",
      "text": "拿下男极KING，\n就等同于抓住了那个“可能性”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e73174752a8e96a90bd1602632b1e81c26bc922f4cd9aa952460a922955a6ded",
      "text": "自己的音乐一定能迈向更高的境界……！啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9260b141ba0bee1fb337171e92528da100888ba65fcede2bb800e286d2890a54",
      "text": "这岂不是不是为了粉丝，\n而是为了自己了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e3c3e70a3f52aca91c8e71c7e19a5d399d2e1ecd52c2049636472460941653",
      "text": "我是想为了支持我的粉丝们\n做些什么的。所以，那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e16235ebe23c4437c41e8abba4a252b0c356b64316a66f11139d2433e61de2",
      "text": "神乐先生、●●●●プロデューサー，\n让二位久等了，实在抱歉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19047f4a1e58b928327f5eaa72304c8117453803251cfb9e1bfeef2db36d499b",
      "text": "拍摄准备已经就绪。\n男极“整蛊部门”，现在正式开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae419f8f077d4f018c09e2ff66121086a83820cee77ca6f4635767b1bba7ddb5",
      "text": "从现在起的30分钟内，\n请不断对对方施展整蛊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a596ad969869ef802c8d6f76903af4a27fb3132f70c8acd0b27441a04007d6",
      "text": "（终于开始了呢，丽先生！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:088a6893495fb8a700a08648164bd5566fd6dcdb444986da2e4da03aa4bae5bf",
      "text": "（嗯！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7921fc0deab1f6df975a3bac7312388dd6b31c12de48673d64c96a8aab7300da",
      "text": "（……我们真正要挑战的，\n是男极“整蛊部门”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b51c6620d6510f4223be58a4b84bf443392495e8381aaf186245b5f8be22ac0c",
      "text": "（考验的是无论被成员恶作剧多少次，\n彼此间是否还能维系羁绊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3a22adfb573dca766aab91a1e3f65d501fa3bc19611e4839cd595f4d2c4136",
      "text": "（虽然对一无所知的都筑先生进行整蛊\n感到有些抱歉）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a53dbc2743cd43254afa8f65d4336b24b74ed991efe960a213423a9177eeacc",
      "text": "？怎么了吗，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c08fdf805640f9567b0999d3230552f85ac634b5032f42ee2605a065789f7faf",
      "text": "啊，没什么。\n我只是在稍微思考信里的内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd3b2625f3feec00f74f7657fd5bf9487d7a055ff17bdc731e865a6bac22afd",
      "text": "（丽先生，冷静下来。加油！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:599469154e441d41ad9be039f71deb22a0456ebfe8ce1cc4ebc632b45b6c9f72",
      "text": "（交给我吧，制作人。为了这一天，\n我已经做好了万全的准备）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0428b807582f5fe196ebc42430a7128bb259b429ad6023ba2bb4933626488630",
      "text": "（为了拿下男极KING。\n请协助我吧，都筑先生！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数日前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f92fae35c80a9da39baddbcf911ac726a310c1de2c9fdd616c6b23cee86e7b6",
      "text": "下周终于要进行男极“整蛊部门”的拍摄了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af735a03a55de8512a27c4063bf1413799ad6ee426c27d043bfe2ebe77e0bf58",
      "text": "丽先生。到当天为止，\n整蛊道具能准备好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bb30c3852a2395ac57a217b3abdf16f1aadcb69cd8caedd07c20ddd602f01b5",
      "text": "嗯。多亏阁下找了北村先生来帮忙，\n应该能勉强赶上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5111a42b96023a4af75ec47e99efd07344ab22fe04b1499f2cb79d88136d80bd",
      "text": "前些日子我和他去了杂货店，\n购买了各种可以用于整蛊的道具。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:065e90c29a845efea4d37d270acab470c14f8a1cddeb6b31b78f96e4f6f29d6a",
      "text": "全都是一些让人惊叹居然还有这种设计的\n精巧物品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e00f1bff05619e9973df6f3964bb49a98ee203ade87cfeadc2ea268820c38df0",
      "text": "就算是像我这样不擅长撒谎的人，\n有了那些道具应该也能顺利完成。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4a2b79e6dc380c173d4d3be664b99d3d336ffd57806aa488a47b721b9356df8",
      "text": "当天我已经告诉圭先生\n是进行“现场表现力部门”的碰头会了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f5000fb55c679c7de3410f334f5892fc9eb807ca333471bec9f0fc2cb13bc70",
      "text": "我也会在场，但按照规则，\n我只能在旁边看着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5654fe9c6b94c0f319a2757cc42ee8e5dc286f3d35286f1817db898c4c4fe99",
      "text": "没问题的。\n我一定会让都筑先生大吃一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0316321726c5e42cc432b3fd07a13d16faf234218564b8323039dc4d245e66d2",
      "text": "（……好，要开始了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d336f50cecbc1d27d72ac8bc3eba3f3be513c65c0dac60510ab5569300eb79d",
      "text": "咳咳。说起来，我把资料带过来了。\n差不多该拿出来了……嗯！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232c452ffc1332ef13e142317daf6d78e11d067d1ace086f7a341715ee6d251c",
      "text": "不好了，都筑先生！\n我的包里莫名其妙冒出了大量的钞票！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069a846921d1f015f691a86c0aa223297794fd371064e9bc1805e831eb6096d4",
      "text": "好厉害啊，丽先生。\n随身带着这么厚的一捆纸吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a47521bdfb899188552e116fb2b94b3900648756009d1d9bc37ce222113ff2",
      "text": "多亏了训练，\n力气变大不少了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90d9e3e44e8e70e2bd8424c248edb502f7fdf848d71e66bf2b194e4553bcdb4",
      "text": "（咦……反应跟我预想的不一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:390638276cea0586ae5a6a8a237d6d7c1ff77cf72bca4c286b7cf492f908e962",
      "text": "（这明明是我竭尽全力的整蛊了……\n不、不行，才刚刚开始呢！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd25d8bc5405e4a208a50032d29d226b0adbf9ec37a4ca23613b1c52cf36ff50",
      "text": "都筑先生，请喝咖啡。\n稍微休息一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3c185aa483930b44db9c6db2389da9a8fe369dbbe5330837ed038660e8ce74",
      "text": "啊，洒到●●●●プロデューサー的\n电脑上了。糟糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c9165efab802b417612dad83c8dfbcf9eac5e905b9da197a16e44ac48b4885d",
      "text": "有那么糟糕吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398f8bf418226d3ddd502db36792a63ca07e8f96dc8077ee213205087c4d2638",
      "text": "是、是的。\n电脑一旦进水，就会导致故障。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1625c79207e5eb9633bfd885ae79092e97ece8988d7a6faaaba8bef570e05e03",
      "text": "可能会开不了机，或者数据丢失。\n所以，是非常糟糕的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5648665e860edc8ef0c55b3f2ad9d3d04c8efcc8ef1ddaa14e748e57ff4135f3",
      "text": "这样啊，那可真糟糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:632d8b54449f4a7be3c44caa5f2cdaf3a73766ea6673705f25f52016c0623f7a",
      "text": "（怎么会。居然完全不为所动……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebfbfdfe8c213ecc08f108153e5c28a68c83a603e539025e32e3238e408a485",
      "text": "（从那之后，丽先生\n对圭先生接连进行了各种整蛊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d033d2ec1ef84888d0ec447317e937043d413b2a8a752befec5ec9f2e0eb3c",
      "text": "（这个也不行吗！没想到居然完全吓不到\n他……但是，下一个是我最有自信的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d0934df641a5602d27a34e48b30b8c4bdabbaa8f65de6393a13f2d2e88253fc",
      "text": "怎么回事！\n我的手里，居然源源不断地变出花来……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbae0255559d0175129f3255026635270acedb96ca5c7567fb478436c94633c3",
      "text": "（藏在手心里的花一朵接一朵地冒出来。\n怎么样都筑先生，简直就像魔法一样吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560933ca2cc5760f39f5b2632bf10e41fbbb95a8d9cceddda0ed749ea43c3d4b",
      "text": "真漂亮呢，插在瓶子里吧。\n水的话我有带哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7f1f9101bf3f3c74fd71dd4441bc4b9b2d27e9417232917b1b61bfbc002877",
      "text": "诶。不，那个请留着自己喝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f1cac1279da5258500d4e4f6a7719b3883ad631f8d220651c63297a568c39c8",
      "text": "您的饭量本来就小，\n怎么能连水都给夺走呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1dc41f424560e294820083644aaa5d9ff904b0e3b952e8e31e3b01741738617",
      "text": "（可恶……为什么就是不成功。\n明明在家里练习了那么多次……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0ef37375ed210f5141cad5b65544d04146a55b58520b03cbef8f19d0b5489d",
      "text": "不好了，姐姐。\n我的手里，源源不断地变出花来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:386c53d3b6176c63981a6bfde4440f08ce1862ecdd56ab06e85e7ee895a8bec6",
      "text": "哎呀，真的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c18a1525942d4096177813317c4d88e1dda0cd70fdd8dd48fa7892bcb123598",
      "text": "……呵呵，真是的，丽先生。\n撒谎的技术真好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90c87738f5742f7ff253abb6e23144170d5c08758e2638c4d91f67d2bb4176c9",
      "text": "呵呵，对不起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f33e767c02f0d9ce8ab2576540de23680f76960761ff0ae141deac3006ee82b",
      "text": "但是，做这种坏事\n就仅限这一次。请放心吧，姐姐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000158:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:333adfce423abe5888cc95a9b52a4ee0bd89e8bcb9bb33f4d33269f1b7bd6778",
      "text": "喂，我是神乐。突然打电话抱歉了。\n能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000168:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7edf5d233a4a792e4c8509e182f3afe9cce956a6d4164b92911c8ac8eac82a73",
      "text": "好的，没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000169:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb6366f59a69191f56381296508428e9b97f5492a09efd20010f0b6a93b39c3a",
      "text": "请不用在意\n时间！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5677cebe7f989d88ae5c8bec690d1cad8f9f2da4e14c9097927aab31aefa2dd7",
      "text": "谢谢。关于男极“整蛊部门”的准备，\n进展得非常顺利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000174:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c2299c3b78fec1752fc04e6adbcbedc93f3902f198f3266fd5f3442c72a265",
      "text": "我在姐姐身上也试了试，\n被夸奖说撒谎的技术很厉害。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000176:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5805ab9337eec82569d6823d0edcc1910f463af528006cf8c9ebf5dae930133",
      "text": "这样一来都筑先生也一定会被吓一跳的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000178:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a696623d299eca1989950114f5ee2b334224716caac79757a5d88f619295f2e3",
      "text": "去把男极KING\n赢下来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000181:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dcdc4ea2a11866c16f2ec2d761b13d0359b02b651f281e5dff69e05985a9df8",
      "text": "那是当然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000183:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffce1b5ed8e9ded7251f651757a29ff7e27cef740b382fce89cf9c2dc3c561ff",
      "text": "为了能跟上至今为止出场的同伴们的步伐，\n我会进一步提升整蛊的精度，迎接当天的到来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_g:cmd-000185:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfb378b19a50259b4813f8aeafe8eea75f45c07ca25d7cbca7788d2442354d7f",
      "text": "阁下也请拭目以待吧。\n那就先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca905a46770492881a69b777f7c67e878345ca896b21ab8cea8ef29b76ba895e",
      "text": "（姐姐明明夸奖过我的……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ffdb8df1c75eb37f9a0369889ad8584dbfca930e6986fe8441deff8e95c28e7",
      "text": "神乐先生，整蛊时间结束了！\n请直接向对方揭晓真相。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1d3701936f0a56be757e71dc274a862d494f4e0ce5a737c82101b05178807d",
      "text": "已、已经结束了吗！？\n我可是一次都还没让都筑先生……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "text": "……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1671821a9d8718aa18a23e66ac957bd4c2e819d616ef52b3a1f5649239c8be0a",
      "text": "……我现在向您说明。\n其实，今天聚在这里是为了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8a8336f691de22915f157a62146148c75b1207db39edc296a08e46aa696835",
      "text": "这样啊，原来是“整蛊部门”啊。\n我完全没注意到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38930ecfe763c837df449a9bc0949b61cfd726217d557498a3c6ff6283a09499",
      "text": "实在非常抱歉……\n但是，居然一次都没能成功。真是不中用……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71fd9cbe3144a3e4dbdbe984c7ebe81f103597baa6df375a6fbcbd4bc2a25862",
      "text": "丽先生，这次的主题并不是“吓到对方”，\n而是“能否与对方维系羁绊”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f47ed1b595cb48872ec527fc1483ec613a3005bfe42d3c905f78cedd05f53b90",
      "text": "虽然话是这么说……但通过这件事，\n我反而越来越搞不懂都筑先生这个人了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c662e291cf5fd0d2ecc3d07357ac052ca749d1e84a392ee562099aa4520b2704",
      "text": "总之两位，今天辛苦了。\n回家之后请好好休息哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb78269651516f22c4cf905ffab8b605ed0ffc6d202b0b52ee51815b769e0956",
      "text": "315 Production的各位，辛苦啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b376c4bf2832500b6d0e73e929546ad260a198250ba59b85ee1755f859a08e2b",
      "text": "……男极“整蛊部门”，\n总算是靠我们自己搞定了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dff5a36215766d77575317dff24dae823bf8b21fb0b3120082620504b319ae2",
      "text": "嗯。今天主办方也没现身，\n我还以为男极真的办不下去了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b583d1e3a67d767fef399dc5d96e23aaf170eb9c11133dcd4f4640369bc6db0",
      "text": "没关系，光靠我们也能撑下去的！\n直到大会结束为止大家一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e4213aa45b4e37b2a8cd0fd0e97089381b3ca912cbab286f938bd6967a7979",
      "text": "（……差不多到了“整蛊部门”播出的日子了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e0c34fbb7fbbb9c1807bc259892fa537059615c497807a12083d95be6afc0a9",
      "text": "（至今依然在反省自己是不是本可以做得更好。\n必须赶紧调整好心态了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d118cf33f882a649a6179d4e917d086584f190c850b0e0eb032be5950efcdd7e",
      "text": "早上好。……咦，都筑先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d782109db23b76dd9b38c94e77bb4c0d11731df386417466cae25a0fe0f8785",
      "text": "您比我来得还早，真罕见呢。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:041b28ef65e81c131d291783a243b72d8ae6e9ae466f77497dedc8496c1c40ed",
      "text": "……丽先生说的，“未知的可能性”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c9609bbbd5364e2e9f958e92e3c97c99719f926d61ce5d78c4d3c66e74f6711",
      "text": "诶？啊、嗯。前阵子说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b0e1b63bb34dec4b5fd408b97751c38f9ef4f39a5eb185f18606abb661c5667",
      "text": "我在成为偶像之后，也开始感受到了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be0c25ee49466a84a5ab92b7f796975d9f1163a89b78db7d752d31de3ec4e488",
      "text": "很不可思议呢。明明不久前的我，\n还蜷缩在昏暗死寂的世界里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8849835485659cc28352de45c325d7ca164fabe6a9b4a372abedac6b6070cb4",
      "text": "……当你说了想要抓住未知的可能性时。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706fcf994b3e814a359b87fe2e366a60c5577eecb6027e099e83c58f1fc34482",
      "text": "我也想和你一起，伸出双手。\n为此，哪怕像这样早早赶来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da5131a8d7284bdee9f1743c458f91a7c81212150450633e443bc3b48d6b2ff",
      "text": "我也想再多努力一点，\n好不被你抛在身后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ab73f969c9c926bc4ba9baeb695189f4eb85c74b8e70b606e6393ddd1e5a4b",
      "text": "呵呵，我都被这样的自己给吓到了呢。\n我们的“整蛊部门”，很成功对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8fc505ad714ef9b5324c9f0a99e5c1a261b579dc9552fb41ec8c7d7faba3bb0",
      "text": "都筑先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1fbdf0da165149d6a9e3b06d64753f3febb07e8ce8e5eb61b10897ecd885a98",
      "text": "虽然我的节奏总是慢半拍……\n今后，也愿意和我一起走下去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6433fb5d84d7c3832cc696e50c1c2785f9069422431e870e4c7c457c10e0831b",
      "text": "嗯……那是当然的！\n今天也先从拉伸韧带开始吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000154:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000161:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e63f2933639d407372c60dfa622b9af46c24b14bb3f31407023176db4e02d3f",
      "text": "抱歉。\n请问可以延长练习室的\n使用时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000163:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eac45b6855021e10962477f5af1f545f3e25f3d1397bf8a1a1c5c53306cfe0cc",
      "text": "没问题哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000163:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc55b862dfda55f849cb3c3a64454f479c0b4c281714b6e42c3aeee838dcb5b1",
      "text": "没问题哦。\n干劲十足呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000164:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b5de228839432db772a4bd0e65aa5aaeeaa1e8cef6ce79bb7f60d33a51235a",
      "text": "后面空着呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000164:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e43b4c41fdbeb3274822c5a620d26bfb978376df0d7c3a5f9f7bfead1f3a081f",
      "text": "后面一直\n空着呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0b8a523dce367faa4b2cacf8af4e6fce2398b767caa3e9206a19310bff5e1f",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1660bef72975dd509defa3ff0139909a9a04c7cb0abd8069547600260fd1a42",
      "text": "都筑先生现在，\n非常积极投入。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89b8334d0302700fe363fb624747a98e05d2333989a0c8b9c8b64c70d0eaceca",
      "text": "他还吃了准备当午餐的\nTamagoya便当。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ccba1d3b2939e577cc7df3dad35781d2fd2c8f5f2a2701d25a513ec6da816e",
      "text": "是这样吧？都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed8f8360dcb92162e3d58d48c496c5d71a4e5db4bb4508fd5d101c3b5122cd1b",
      "text": "难得有机会，\n请向制作人\n也汇报一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03072fc100db1abd7f21c04d30691d7e3242dc00b6d8534b31279490c8f1bef5",
      "text": "虽然很快就\n吃饱了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01280c0a01fbf881bdfab3dc51618e4c1d51be9e2551352588320f12dd4d0da",
      "text": "不过很好吃哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_i:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f87b973f9e549b5e6ef1b4bef81cb1c6615b0fd6b14d1fbe2d97cc91554335",
      "text": "非常棒的进步。\n接下来也继续加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069a846921d1f015f691a86c0aa223297794fd371064e9bc1805e831eb6096d4",
      "text": "好厉害啊，丽先生。\n随身带着这么厚的一捆纸吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:319976842a4c4590aa0506b9b85b281040d4034d877ce6b865baeadd5c2fa3c2",
      "text": "怀才在身，不溺于才，勤而不辍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bceac19454547ed2d732bfae855c26add2933c1dc8c758b5efb964dfba67f019",
      "text": "（明明天然呆得要命，却还能这样努力。\nAltessimo无论是敌是友，都是可怕的存在呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29d73f28b08b842ec4efc9ea13473e8a6d28b7f7cab588862481c55e12358d0",
      "text": "早安啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e598420d8367be7026a8229e15ea6a7f3dcad1721f2cede2d29b2007f6e178dc",
      "text": "早上好，想乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:285f66458901f14591cb700a829079cf2d2c88278727b367d11d621d90f5e869",
      "text": "雨彦先生、克里斯先生。早～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364357f597a8f2291df1a1e0baca3e1e61a7ade249146251d3966196d43bbfaf",
      "text": "（对啦。我也来逗逗他们两个好了——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a53e5cd404cb87d3bd5b58cdded85c5cf3ca5fb8fb0ba238ce54ca0648b01394",
      "text": "哇～，不好啦～。●●●●プロデューサー的\n办公桌上，堆了好多钱哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31b2d2f8bc283eb2f91695697283da68639c76923c4f57e4f57ce3fe3781ab1d",
      "text": "感觉闻到了不干净的钱的味道呢～\n两位，要怎么办呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fc37bfadca1a43de38389c8249cd1fc4b49c9722689e1c81e7f1e109b975dab",
      "text": "嚯，事务所的小金库什么的吗？\n趁着闹大之前，咱们先赶紧把它处理掉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca5592a26e26df40064ed69404e27f40c827e4eca331247803db626a8216ab32",
      "text": "所以北村，\n去便利店帮我买本摩托车杂志回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b73618e66bf7e20781e5a15c2b6b24fcbef931b6845654e775f5bf7afd17569",
      "text": "雨彦，这样做不太好吧？所幸，\n我们事务所有曾经当过警察的握野先生在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0669ee49745f7018d615247bc3a6d2f8411172e6ef5ff8267644299b706b5809",
      "text": "如果制作人犯了法，应该通过握野\n先生劝其自首才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4baf2585093c84f815ad52b62c5a370fa0894509f71709ff291ae24a209a9823",
      "text": "…………\n就不能更坦率地吓一跳或者感到困扰一下吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9d2e04e6446bba007b61f4430ad4f3f03cb68283b52852163d1837a69f8f7de",
      "text": "（这个事务所里，不是天然呆\n就是爱较真。怪人真多呢——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1625c79207e5eb9633bfd885ae79092e97ece8988d7a6faaaba8bef570e05e03",
      "text": "可能会开不了机，或者数据丢失。\n所以，是非常糟糕的事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3096622d568a7bee32c88ba7530e214c2dcc1757a32f2d1dde98ea0b03fa113",
      "text": "……我也好想听丽君\n讲讲当时的辛酸史呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
